/*
 * subscript-typegpu.h — generated by `subscript-typegpu-webgpu-gen` from `webgpu.yml`
 * plus `policy.toml`.
 * Regenerate with `tools/regen.sh`; never hand-edit
 * (the byte-identical regeneration gate enforces this).
 *
 * The facade shape rules (facade.md, facade-generator.md): opaque handles only, futures as plain
 * uint64_t, no by-value structs, no callbacks, no unions, no chained
 * structs, no constants >= 2^53. Every construct here must be mapped
 * by `subscript bind` without loss.
 */
